OL,3,GNEWSAWedding venue closes due to
OL,4,Asuspected WW2 bombs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wedding venue has had to close and
OL,7,Fnearby properties have been evacuated
OL,8,Fafter five suspected bombs from World
OL,9,FWar Two were discovered.
OL,11,FGloucestershire Police said they were
OL,12,Fcalled to the Great Tythe Barn in
OL,13,FTetbury at 09:30 GMT after construction
OL,14,Fworkers digging in a planned solar
OL,15,Fpanel field found the suspected
OL,16,Fexplosives.
OL,18,FA 200-metre area was cordoned off and
OL,19,Fthe Explosive Ordnance Disposal is due
OL,20,Fto detonate the items later on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
