OL,3,GNEWSAWedding venue closes due to
OL,4,Asuspected WW2 bombs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMegan Fletcher, sales and marketing
OL,7,Fexecutive at the Great Tythe Barn, said
OL,8,Fno events had been scheduled at the
OL,9,Fvenue. She added: "We are asking
OL,10,Feveryone to stay away from the area and
OL,11,Fto follow the instructions of the
OL,12,Femergency services."
